        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{dy}{dx}=\\dfrac12(x+4)^{-\\frac12}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=(x+4)^{\\frac12}\\\\\\frac{dy}{dx}&=\\frac12(x+4)^{-\\frac12}(1)\\\\\\frac{dy}{dx}&=\\frac12(x+4)^{-\\frac12}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
