          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}y&=(5-3x)^{\\frac12}\\\\\\frac{dy}{dx}&=\\frac12(5-3x)^{-\\frac12}(-3)\\\\\\frac{dy}{dx}&=-\\frac32(5-3x)^{-\\frac12}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
